            "id": "4674430",
            "title": "Markel Group boosts share repurchase authorization by $2.5B",
            "description": "<html><body><ul>\n<li><div><div><p data-eci=\"true\">Markel Group (<span class=\"ticker-hover-wrapper\"><span class=\"ticker-hover-wrapper\"><a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/MKL\" title=\"Markel Group Inc.\">MKL</a></span></span>) announced on Wednesday that its board approved a $2.5B increase to its existing <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/pr/20733300-markel-group-announces-2_5-billion-increase-to-share-repurchase-authorization\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"share repurchase authorization\">share repurchase authorization</a>.</p></div></div></li>\n<li><div><div><p>The company may repurchase shares through open-market or privately negotiated transactions.</p></div></div></li>\n<li><div><div><p>The authorization has no expiration date, and the timing and amount of repurchases will depend on market conditions and capital needs.</p></div></div></li>\n</ul>\n</body></html>",
