            "id": "4674392",
            "title": "IM Cannabis to consolidate share for Nasdaq compliance",
            "description": "<html><body><ul>\n<li>\n<span>IM Cannabis (</span><span class=\"ticker-hover-wrapper\"><span class=\"ticker-hover-wrapper\"><a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/IMCC\" title=\"IM Cannabis Corp.\">IMCC</a></span></span><span>) said on Wednesday that its board has approved a 3:1 share consolidation of its issued and outstanding common shares, no par value per share.</span>\n</li>\n<li><span><span>The primary purpose of the consolidation is to increase the per-share trading price of the common shares to support the company's efforts to maintain compliance with Nasdaq's US$1.00 minimum bid price requirement for continued listing, the company added. </span></span></li>\n<li><span>The company anticipates the common shares to begin trading on the Nasdaq on a post-consolidation basis at the opening of trading on November 23, 2026.</span></li>\n<li><span>Following the consolidation, the issued and outstanding common shares are expected to be reduced from 1,844,162 to nearly 614,721 shares.</span></li>\n<li><span><a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/pr/20733200-im-cannabis-announces-intention-to-complete-3-1-share-consolidation-to-support-nasdaq-minimum\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Press Release\">Press Release</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</body></html>",
            "image": "https://static.seekingalpha.com/assets/og_image_1200-29b2bfe1a595477db6826bd2126c63ac2091efb7ec76347a8e7f81ba17e3de6c.png",
